          %h3#in_smatrix_theories_and_string_theory_2 In S-matrix theories and string theory
          %p
            Discussion of causality in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            includes the following:
          %p A brief look at the causality property of the string 2-point function is in
          %ul
            %li#Martinec95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Emil+Martinec"}> Emil Martinec
              ,
              %em Strings and Causality
